[[3,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Disconnect the rear section of the single supply pipe from the pump.</p><p>2. Using the tool (2a), undo the ring nut (2b) and remove the fuel pump (2c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000695.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Tool. for removing. fuel pump retaining ring nut</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.854.033.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223001735.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the fuel pump and tighten the ring nut.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Replace the gasket under the fuel pump and take care, when refitting, to check that the gasket is correctly positioned in order to ensure the seal.</p></aside><p>Tighten the ring nut to torque using the special tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000695.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Tool. for removing. fuel pump retaining ring nut</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.854.033.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000656.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>SUBMERGED FUEL PUMP RING NUT</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.6</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the rear section of the single supply pipe to the pump.</p>"],[4,7,16896,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Unscrew the retaining nuts.</p><p>2. Remove the retaining ring nut.</p><p>3. Withdraw the immersed pump assembly.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223001736.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,7,16896,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the immersed pump assembly.</p><p>Fit the retaining ring nut and secure it by means of the nuts.</p>"]]